  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "參與式設計專論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON PARTICIPATORY DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹參與式設計的相關理論、概念與操作目標，並透過實際案例的參訪，讓學生接觸社區，瞭解社區透過參與式規劃所呈現的在地精神、社區文化特色、以及社區與城市發展的關係。",
    "describe_eh": "1.\tIntroduction of the theory, concept and practice of participatory design.\r\n2.\tVisiting communities for understanding the influences of participatory planning on the making of genius loci, everyday cultural characteristics, and the relationships between the communities and urban development.\r\n",
